                                                "sense_id": "29ccb755-321d-37d5-aafb-ce0fb51fcec1",
                                                "text": "The Biden large-donor scene, where Mr. Katzenberg is treated as royalty himself, has been devastated since Mr. Biden’s debate performance two weeks ago."
